<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89362" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσηγορ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for addressing</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὄνομα</span>,= Lat. <i>praenomen</i>,
			opp. <i>nomen</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ συγγενικόν</span>),
				<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				3.65
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				4.1
			</span></i>; also,= <i>cognomen</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Mar.</u>
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Gramm.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ π</span>. <i>appellatives</i>,
			opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὀνοματικά</span>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνομα κύριον ἢ
			π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				120.23
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.T.
				636.9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἁπλᾶ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Stat.</u>
				1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τῶν π</span>., title of
			work by Chrysippus, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				7.192
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>
			<i>by</i> one's <i>common name</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.150
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ π. "ἄρμενα" καλούμενα</span>
			<i>vulgarly</i> called 'tackle', <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(2).717
			</span></i>.</div>
